# The Entra image (deephaven-entra-oidc-server/docker/deephaven/Dockerfile) builds with the repo
# root as context so it can COPY the Gradle-built fat jar and the shared app.d. Keep the context
# small: exclude everything heavy, then re-include exactly what the Dockerfiles COPY.
.git
.gradle
.idea
**/build
**/.gradle
# Re-include the fat jar the Entra Dockerfile needs (built by :deephaven-entra-oidc-server:fatJar).
!deephaven-entra-oidc-server/build/libs/deephaven-entra-oidc-auth-all.jar
